1
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:43,080
So you're saying

2
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,640
I, Guo Zijian,

3
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:47,160
am now the biggest joke of the entire exercise.

4
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:48,720
Acting Brigade Commander Suo,

5
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:50,480
what happened with Wu Dongsheng

6
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:52,280
was entirely my own

7
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:53,720
arbitrary decision.

8
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,480
It has nothing to do with anyone else.

9
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,080
Whether I'm transferred or removed,

10
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,760
whatever the punishment is,

11
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:02,600
I accept it.

12
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:36,160
Staff Officer Liang.

13
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,720
Hello, Battalion Commander Guo.

14
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:42,320
Today, your 1st Battalion's

15
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:45,360
debriefing has completely concluded.

16
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:50,000
As for your exercise summary,

17
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:51,240
I've read it.

18
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,400
It's very well written.

19
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,760
Your Political Instructor showed it to me.

20
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:00,960
Also,

21
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:03,880
I went to the hospital yesterday.

22
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:05,720
Wu Dongsheng has been discharged.

23
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,160
The doctor said he's recovering well.

24
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,160
Rest assured.

25
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,560
I know.

26
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:10,960
And also...

27
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,160
The Military Region is currently researching

28
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:15,560
topics related to new-type combat forces.

29
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,360
Staff Officer Liang,

30
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:18,440
what exactly are you trying to say?

31
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:19,680
It's nothing.

32
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,960
You...

33
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,200
Are you enjoying your leave?

34
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:30,880
It's been good.

35
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:33,760
That's good. Goodbye then.

36
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:08,360
Report.

37
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,320
Come in.

38
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:13,320
Speak.

39
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,840
He's still running outside.

40
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:15,760
It's been over three hours.

41
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,440
Brigade Commander,

42
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,400
Yang Maolin is as stubborn as a mule.

43
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,600
You're the mule.

44
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,800
I'm telling you.

45
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,240
Yang Maolin is my treasure.

46
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,880
Should we still make him run?

47
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:40,880
No more running.

48
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:42,040
Can't you see it's raining?

49
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,560
Tell him to hurry back to bed.

50
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,320
Yes, sir.

51
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:45,680
Wait.

52
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:49,840
Keep a close eye on him.

53
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,800
If anything happens to him,

54
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:53,800
you'll answer to me.

55
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,400
Yes, sir.

56
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,440
I don't know what this kid is thinking.

57
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:58,120
Why does he insist on going to the 396th Brigade?

58
00:04:59,240 --> 00:04:59,840
Alright.

59
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,280
Consider this matter closed.

60
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:03,760
I'm telling you,

61
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:06,400
Yang Maolin is a loyal and honorable soldier.

62
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:08,840
I absolutely forbid any retaliation.

63
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,080
Understood?

64
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:11,080
Yes, sir.

65
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:33,760
I know

66
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:38,040
you're now the absolute backbone of the 404th Brigade,

67
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:39,800
and I also know

68
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:43,040
Long Yuanshan is heavily invested in grooming you.

69
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,920
But I just have this selfish wish.

70
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:49,120
Maybe you

71
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:52,640
look down on our 1st Battalion.

72
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:57,480
But I can tell you proudly,

73
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,560
making your Black Mamba

74
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,720
almost stumble

75
00:06:02,440 --> 00:06:05,240
only took our 1st Battalion three months.

76
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,520
Now,

77
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,840
I can't stand guard anymore.

78
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,440
I've thought it over and over,

79
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,000
and only if you come over

80
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:19,520
can I leave with peace of mind.

81
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,080
And leave with no regrets.

82
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:23,960
Squad Leader,

83
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,560
I understand what you mean.

84
00:06:28,760 --> 00:06:29,520
But...

85
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:34,160
give me some time.

86
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:35,920
Don't worry.

87
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,840
Whether it works out or not,

88
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:42,720
your Squad Leader thanks you.

89
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,120
Reporting, sir.

90
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:03,880
I have something to report.

91
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:07,560
He's Yang Maolin from the 404th Brigade,

92
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:09,520
champion of the all-army competition.

93
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,160
Long Yuanshan's soldier.

94
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,200
Go ahead.

95
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:17,240
Why transfer to the 1st Battalion of the 396th Brigade?

96
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:20,440
I cost the 1st Battalion a recon Squad Leader,

97
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:22,440
so I'm paying them back with a recon Squad Leader.

98
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:26,480
Big talk.

99
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,320
Aren't you afraid they won't accept you?

100
00:07:29,840 --> 00:07:30,440
No, sir.

101
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:32,480
I'm confident I can overcome any difficulty.

102
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,760
All right, I got it.

103
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:36,600
Dismissed.

104
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:38,920
Does that mean you agree, sir?

105
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,760
I know it's inappropriate to come to you.

106
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,440
I'll accept any punishment.

107
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:47,000
I'm clumsy with words,

108
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,160
but I really hope

109
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,680
you'll consider my request, sir.

110
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:52,520
This was also my old Squad Leader's

111
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:53,600
last wish before leaving the army.

112
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:20,880
Chief,

113
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,640
what have you decided to do?

114
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:25,800
What do you think we should do?

115
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:31,320
I think Yang Maolin, on the surface,

116
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:33,400
looks like a quiet type,

117
00:08:33,799 --> 00:08:35,440
but that stubborn streak in him

118
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,880
is just like Guo Zijian's.

119
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,880
What exactly are you trying to say?

120
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,240
Stop beating around the bush.

121
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:49,800
Speak.

122
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:52,000
Here's what I'm thinking.

123
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:54,520
Aren't we currently exploring

124
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:56,680
the combined use of new-type combat forces?

125
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:58,640
If equipment can be combined,

126
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:02,000
shouldn't personnel be properly combined too?

127
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:02,960
Let Yang Maolin

128
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:05,080
fill the gap in the Red 1st Battalion.

129
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:07,200
Not bad, Xu Lingjun.

130
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,560
You've really made progress.

131
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,800
That makes perfect sense.

132
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:14,840
The combined use of new-type combat forces

133
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:17,280
involves different branches and services.

134
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:18,520
It's highly complex.

135
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:20,240
Do a thorough study on it.

136
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,480
If it's feasible,

137
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,160
let's give it a shot.

138
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,240
Yes, sir.

139
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:26,880
Chief,

140
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:29,920
the 404th Brigade has produced a traitor.

141
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:31,080
Long Yuanshan

142
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,480
must be absolutely furious.

143
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,480
Look at you gloating.

144
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:37,480
It's so unseemly.

145
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:38,560
I couldn't help it.

146
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,720
You've got some nerve.

147
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,360
I just don't understand.

148
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:48,320
How have I, Long Yuanshan, mistreated you?

149
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:49,880
Brigade Commander,

150
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:52,600
I remember all your kindness.

151
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:54,000
But Brigade Commander,

152
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:57,160
I still want to go to the 396th Brigade's 1st Battalion.

153
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:58,840
Give up on that idea right now.

154
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,160
Let me tell you, Yang Maolin,

155
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:04,560
even if Deputy Army Commander Liang came here to ask for you,

156
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:06,800
I absolutely won't let you go.

157
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:42,160
Yang Maolin!

158
00:10:42,520 --> 00:10:43,760
Are you ever going to drop this?

159
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,640
If you've got too much energy, go train.

160
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:51,640
Brigade Commander, please approve my application.

161
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:57,880
You want to leave?

162
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:00,120
Beat me first, then we'll talk.

163
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,840
Come on!

164
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,400
Scared?

165
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:36,840
Get up!

166
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:39,840
Fight back!

167
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:41,600
Get up!

168
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:51,960
Why won't you fight back?

169
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:55,200
Fight back!

170
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:22,960
Commander.

171
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:25,840
I owe you this.

172
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:39,480
You brat

173
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:08,640
I'm leaving.

174
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:11,200
My train is this afternoon.

175
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:14,640
You broke your promise.

176
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:16,800
You didn't even attend my graduation,

177
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:17,600
and now you're leaving.

178
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:18,880
Stop making a fuss.

179
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:21,680
Is everything packed?

180
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,120
All packed.

181
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:24,960
Are you mentally prepared?

182
00:13:25,280 --> 00:13:26,000
I am.

183
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:28,320
Don't worry.

184
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:30,600
I've arranged everything for Wu Dongsheng.

185
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,840
Once the new smart prosthetic limb rolls out,

186
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:34,480
he will be among the first

187
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:36,240
clinical trial participants.

188
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:39,280
If he has any other needs,

189
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:41,200
our company will do everything we can.

190
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:43,680
We'll make sure he has nothing to worry about.

191
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:47,560
Thank you.

192
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:50,040
Stay for a meal before you go.

193
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,280
I'll pass.

194
00:13:51,680 --> 00:13:52,800
My ride will be here soon.

195
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:53,800
Okay.

196
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:56,080
That's how a soldier should be.

197
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:16,840
Dad

198
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:18,240
Goodbye

199
00:14:29,640 --> 00:14:32,320
Dad, did you hear what he called you?

200
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,640
He called me "Dad."

201
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:43,440
Why did Zijian leave?

202
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:45,640
That kid...

203
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:47,040
He made a bowl of noodles just for you,

204
00:14:47,040 --> 00:14:48,720
and left without eating anything himself.

205
00:14:50,760 --> 00:14:51,560
Let's eat.

206
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:22,000
Are you really just letting him go?

207
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:25,120
Not going to see him off?

208
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:34,080
What will be, will be.

209
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:36,760
He's dead set on leaving.

210
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:38,640
There's no stopping him.

211
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,320
What's the point of seeing him off?

212
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:47,920
Exactly.

213
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:50,240
He's just a hotheaded soldier. Why get worked up over him?

214
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:54,160
Am I getting worked up over him?

215
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:57,200
I just hate to lose him.

216
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:59,960
We finally trained a real talent,

217
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,960
only to have him poached away from us.

218
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,680
Did Deputy Army Commander Liang really sign off on this?

219
00:17:12,839 --> 00:17:14,240
What is he up to?

220
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:15,920
Is he making a joke out of us?

221
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:18,040
This kid is blindly loyal,

222
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:18,880
and the Chief...

223
00:17:23,040 --> 00:17:23,760
is being foolish.

224
00:17:24,079 --> 00:17:24,800
Foolish?

225
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:26,880
Let me tell you,

226
00:17:27,839 --> 00:17:29,720
the Chief isn't foolish.

227
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:32,000
He's very shrewd.

228
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:34,000
By transferring Yang Maolin,

229
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:37,000
he might be playing a bigger game.

230
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,840
Just with a recon squad leader?

231
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:40,440
It might not just be a recon squad leader.

232
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:44,920
Alright.

233
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:46,680
Enough about Yang Maolin.

234
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:48,080
Make a trip to the train station for me later.

235
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:49,880
The train station?

236
00:17:50,040 --> 00:17:50,800
To pick someone up.

237
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:53,720
They poached my treasure,

238
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:57,520
so I have to make them pay me back with a mountain of gold.

239
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:01,200
Got to hand it to you, Old Long.

240
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:02,080
I'll arrange it right away.

241
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:04,040
What time do they arrive?

242
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:05,160
I'll send it to your phone.

243
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:06,320
Yes, sir.

244
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,640
Third-Term Sergeant Yang Maolin

245
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,800
reporting for duty, sir.

246
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:31,320
Welcome to the 396th Brigade.

247
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:33,480
Have a seat.

248
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:34,320
Yes, sir.

249
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:38,680
How is it going? Is your paperwork done?

250
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:39,640
Reporting, sir.

251
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:40,480
Not yet.

252
00:18:40,760 --> 00:18:41,520
What's the reason?

253
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:42,920
I can help you sort it out.

254
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:44,440
I'm applying for the 1st Battalion.

255
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,360
It seems you're

256
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:50,440
not satisfied

257
00:18:50,760 --> 00:18:51,880
with the work

258
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:52,920
assigned to you.

259
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:54,640
Reporting, sir.

260
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:56,560
I came to the 396th Brigade

261
00:18:56,560 --> 00:18:58,840
at the request of my old squad leader, Wu Dongsheng,

262
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:00,840
to return a King of Soldiers to the 1st Battalion.

263
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:02,000
Quite confident, aren't you?

264
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:03,360
Good.

265
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:07,320
As a soldier, you should have that confidence.

266
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:09,240
Since you're a King of Soldiers,

267
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:11,600
then prove it to us.

268
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:13,680
Let's see if you truly have the capability

269
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:15,280
to live up to the title of King of Soldiers.

270
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:16,120
But...

271
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:16,640
Oh, right.

272
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:18,800
Deputy Army Commander Liang had one more message.

273
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:21,400
If you're unwilling to obey the arrangements,

274
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:23,440
you can transfer back to the 404th Brigade anytime.

275
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:24,800
I...

276
00:19:29,840 --> 00:19:31,200
I will obey the arrangements.

277
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:32,440
Go report for duty.

278
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:35,040
Yes, sir.

279
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:47,480
Hello, Chief.

280
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:57,960
Reporting!

281
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:58,640
Come in.

282
00:20:04,280 --> 00:20:05,960
What concerns are you here to report this time?

283
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:07,280
Sir,

284
00:20:07,320 --> 00:20:09,440
I have absolutely no concerns to report.

285
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:11,800
Ever since Guo Zijian went on leave,

286
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:14,040
you've been coming to report on your work every few days.

287
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:16,080
No work to report today?

288
00:20:16,280 --> 00:20:16,960
None.

289
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:23,000
Well, that's a first.

290
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:25,480
Then what are you here for?

291
00:20:28,280 --> 00:20:29,640
What are you grinning at?

292
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:32,120
I heard...

293
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:35,000
Battalion Commander Guo is returning, right?

294
00:20:37,760 --> 00:20:38,600
Commissar,

295
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:40,320
all the officers and soldiers of the 1st Battalion

296
00:20:40,320 --> 00:20:42,040
are very eager to know.

297
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:50,000
He wants to return to duty early.

298
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:52,560
Did you leak something to him?

299
00:20:52,760 --> 00:20:53,440
Commissar.

300
00:20:53,600 --> 00:20:55,120
You're really wronging me then.

301
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,600
Regarding the disciplinary decision on him,

302
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,680
how many times have I asked you about it?

303
00:20:58,680 --> 00:21:00,400
You only told me just now.

304
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:02,200
If I wanted to leak something,

305
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:04,720
I wouldn't even have had the time, right?

306
00:21:08,560 --> 00:21:09,480
Give me a break.

307
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:10,840
Sit.

308
00:21:13,760 --> 00:21:15,280
Actually, the disciplinary decision for him

309
00:21:15,280 --> 00:21:16,120
was made a long time ago.

310
00:21:17,120 --> 00:21:18,360
We just wanted to see

311
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:20,240
if he could get past his own mental hurdle.

312
00:21:20,760 --> 00:21:21,440
Otherwise,

313
00:21:21,520 --> 00:21:23,680
even if the leadership wants to protect him,

314
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:25,280
if he gives up and wants to leave,

315
00:21:26,760 --> 00:21:27,880
it would all be meaningless.

316
00:21:28,080 --> 00:21:28,720
Wouldn't you say so?

317
00:21:28,720 --> 00:21:29,400
Yes.

318
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:31,200
Commissar.

319
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:33,520
So based on what you're saying,

320
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:36,200
he has passed this hurdle?

321
00:21:36,200 --> 00:21:36,640
Passed?

322
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:38,800
Not even close.

323
00:21:39,160 --> 00:21:40,360
This is only the first hurdle.

324
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:41,640
Commissar.

325
00:21:42,280 --> 00:21:44,120
Since Battalion Commander Guo

326
00:21:44,360 --> 00:21:45,480
regarding his own issues

327
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:47,440
has already reflected deeply,

328
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:50,120
and voluntarily requested an early return to duty,

329
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:51,600
then regarding his punishment,

330
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:54,600
could we consider being lenient?

331
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:56,680
Xiao Sang, you must know,

332
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:58,840
between realization and action,

333
00:21:58,920 --> 00:22:00,640
there's a world of difference.

334
00:22:01,440 --> 00:22:03,360
As for this disciplinary decision on him,

335
00:22:03,360 --> 00:22:04,960
it was decided by the Brigade Party Committee.

336
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:06,000
It's no child's play.

337
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:08,320
We can't just change or revoke it on a whim.

338
00:22:08,560 --> 00:22:09,960
And you call yourself a Party Committee Secretary.

339
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:12,760
Besides,

340
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:15,400
when the unit organizes such a large exercise,

341
00:22:16,280 --> 00:22:17,400
personnel getting injured,

342
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:19,360
or even casualties, is completely normal.

343
00:22:20,040 --> 00:22:22,600
The organization wouldn't just ignore Wu Dongsheng either.

344
00:22:22,600 --> 00:22:23,320
Right?

345
00:22:24,080 --> 00:22:25,560
It's just that Guo Zijian

346
00:22:25,560 --> 00:22:27,480
has been brooding over it,

347
00:22:30,600 --> 00:22:33,080
and even lost his mind a bit.

348
00:22:33,080 --> 00:22:35,280
He actually barged into the Brigade Party Committee meeting.

349
00:22:35,440 --> 00:22:36,800
I kept signaling him with my eyes

350
00:22:36,840 --> 00:22:38,040
to leave immediately,

351
00:22:38,080 --> 00:22:40,440
but he just stood there and refused to move.

352
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:42,560
See how stubborn he is?

353
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:45,560
Making the committee members say I'm playing favorites.

354
00:22:45,800 --> 00:22:47,560
Everyone saw it very clearly.

355
00:22:52,280 --> 00:22:54,880
This exactly shows his immaturity.

356
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:56,560
He needs even more to use his work

357
00:22:57,040 --> 00:22:57,840
to temper himself.

358
00:22:58,760 --> 00:22:59,640
And you,

359
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:01,440
when something like this happens,

360
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:03,680
as the Party Committee Secretary,

361
00:23:04,040 --> 00:23:05,440
you also bear some responsibility.

362
00:23:06,120 --> 00:23:08,080
Your ideological work was inadequate.

363
00:23:08,320 --> 00:23:08,840
Commissar.

364
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:11,880
Everything you said is absolutely right.

365
00:23:12,120 --> 00:23:14,200
Every word is for Guo Zijian's own good.

366
00:23:14,520 --> 00:23:16,600
I don't think you are playing favorites.

367
00:23:16,840 --> 00:23:18,520
You love your soldiers like sons.

368
00:23:20,720 --> 00:23:21,360
But,

369
00:23:22,040 --> 00:23:23,120
I feel that

370
00:23:24,120 --> 00:23:25,560
in your heart,

371
00:23:26,520 --> 00:23:27,680
you know better than anyone else

372
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:28,640
that Guo Zijian

373
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:30,040
cares most deeply about

374
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:32,600
the Recon Squad Leader of our 1st Battalion,

375
00:23:32,600 --> 00:23:33,360
Wu Dongsheng.

376
00:23:34,840 --> 00:23:35,840
From the day Battalion Commander Guo

377
00:23:36,160 --> 00:23:37,920
arrived at our battalion,

378
00:23:38,360 --> 00:23:40,600
towards every officer and soldier in our 1st Battalion,

379
00:23:40,600 --> 00:23:42,400
he has poured in so much of his heart and soul.

380
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:44,400
The changes in our 1st Battalion

381
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:45,880
are obvious to everyone.

382
00:23:46,280 --> 00:23:47,600
This kind of bond

383
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:50,120
is too deep.

384
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:54,440
I understand all of this.

385
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:57,280
That's also why everyone is giving him a chance.

386
00:23:57,800 --> 00:23:59,000
As for the Recon Squad Leader...

387
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:02,200
The person who just walked out,

388
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:03,280
do you know him?

389
00:24:03,600 --> 00:24:05,520
He looks familiar, but I can't name him.

390
00:24:05,520 --> 00:24:07,560
Special Ops Squad Leader of the 404th Brigade Recon Battalion,

391
00:24:08,280 --> 00:24:09,320
Yang Maolin.

392
00:24:14,600 --> 00:24:16,080
What's he doing here?

393
00:24:16,440 --> 00:24:17,360
This kid

394
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:19,760
wrote a letter in blood to Deputy Army Commander Liang,

395
00:24:20,640 --> 00:24:21,960
asking to replace Wu Dongsheng

396
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:23,160
and come to 1st Battalion

397
00:24:23,320 --> 00:24:24,720
as a recon squad leader.

398
00:24:25,680 --> 00:24:26,440
He actually

399
00:24:26,600 --> 00:24:28,520
wrote a letter in blood?

400
00:24:29,720 --> 00:24:30,280
Commissar,

401
00:24:31,280 --> 00:24:32,440
what era are we in?

402
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:33,840
Still pulling stunts like this.

403
00:24:34,120 --> 00:24:36,200
Isn't he just trying to coerce our leaders?

404
00:24:37,320 --> 00:24:39,600
Deputy Army Commander Liang probably won't agree, right?

405
00:24:39,680 --> 00:24:40,320
He did.

406
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:42,000
If he really comes to 1st Battalion,

407
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:43,600
Lin Yihu and his guys will definitely eat him alive.

408
00:24:43,600 --> 00:24:45,200
How am I supposed to do the ideological work then?

409
00:24:45,360 --> 00:24:46,320
What are you so anxious about?

410
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:48,480
Deputy Army Commander Liang only half-agreed.

411
00:24:48,480 --> 00:24:49,280
What do you mean, half?

412
00:24:49,280 --> 00:24:50,480
He's coming to the 396th Brigade,

413
00:24:50,560 --> 00:24:51,920
but not to 1st Battalion for now.

414
00:24:55,520 --> 00:24:56,640
The commanders truly

415
00:24:57,040 --> 00:24:58,720
think of everything.

416
00:25:01,280 --> 00:25:02,040
Then

417
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:03,800
where is he going?

418
00:25:04,160 --> 00:25:05,600
Alright, alright, alright.

419
00:25:05,600 --> 00:25:07,400
Stop putting on a show.

420
00:25:07,920 --> 00:25:09,400
Stop pretending.

421
00:25:10,400 --> 00:25:11,560
Since he's not coming to 1st Battalion,

422
00:25:12,160 --> 00:25:14,200
you don't need to worry about the rest.

423
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:17,440
Then let me pour you some hot water.

424
00:25:19,840 --> 00:25:20,440
Commissar,

425
00:25:21,080 --> 00:25:24,240
regarding the handling of Guo Zijian,

426
00:25:24,440 --> 00:25:25,520
I personally think,

427
00:25:25,920 --> 00:25:26,800
a word to the wise

428
00:25:27,040 --> 00:25:28,280
is enough.

429
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:30,560
Wipe that smirk off your face.

430
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:32,240
Just pour the hot water.

431
00:25:38,440 --> 00:25:39,280
Battalion Commander Guo.

432
00:25:41,280 --> 00:25:42,040
Chief of Staff Yi.

433
00:25:42,880 --> 00:25:44,800
You really live up to your special recon background.

434
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:47,080
We only met once at the debriefing,

435
00:25:47,080 --> 00:25:48,360
I didn't expect you to still remember me.

436
00:25:48,640 --> 00:25:50,600
It's mostly because you sing so well, Chief of Staff.

437
00:25:51,960 --> 00:25:53,520
Say fight, and...

438
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:56,000
Old Long did it on purpose.

439
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:57,000
He loves pulling this kind of stuff.

440
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:58,200
Come on, I'll take you to meet someone.

441
00:25:58,880 --> 00:26:00,440
Do you think I'd sell you out?

442
00:26:09,080 --> 00:26:10,200
This is where our

443
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:12,200
Core Command System is located.

444
00:26:13,080 --> 00:26:13,840
Well,

445
00:26:16,400 --> 00:26:17,360
Brigade Commander Long,

446
00:26:17,560 --> 00:26:19,600
you've shown me all these treasures,

447
00:26:19,800 --> 00:26:20,920
what exactly is your point?

448
00:26:21,120 --> 00:26:23,520
I've shown you everything I have.

449
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:25,320
What do you think it means?

450
00:26:27,280 --> 00:26:29,280
I'm someone who's about to get kicked out anyway.

451
00:26:30,440 --> 00:26:31,920
According to the current policy,

452
00:26:32,160 --> 00:26:33,200
you can't leave.

453
00:26:33,520 --> 00:26:35,920
Because your reason for requesting a discharge isn't special enough.

454
00:26:36,720 --> 00:26:38,040
According to reliable sources,

455
00:26:38,520 --> 00:26:41,080
if you stay in the 396th Brigade,

456
00:26:41,080 --> 00:26:42,160
things will be rough.

457
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:44,280
It might even affect your career.

458
00:26:45,520 --> 00:26:47,280
So I sincerely hope

459
00:26:47,520 --> 00:26:49,520
you can come to our 404th Brigade.

460
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:51,120
We can work together

461
00:26:51,200 --> 00:26:54,360
to build a top-tier Blue Force Brigade in the army.

462
00:26:54,800 --> 00:26:55,880
Why me?

463
00:26:56,840 --> 00:26:58,200
During the Battle of Huangtuling,

464
00:26:58,480 --> 00:27:01,240
although your strike was ultimately ruled invalid,

465
00:27:01,560 --> 00:27:03,200
you sharply caught on

466
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:04,360
to the trap I set,

467
00:27:04,360 --> 00:27:06,200
and accurately determined

468
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:07,560
the location of my command post.

469
00:27:07,560 --> 00:27:10,000
That alone proves your capability.

470
00:27:10,680 --> 00:27:11,840
But in the end,

471
00:27:12,120 --> 00:27:14,080
I still fell for your trick.

472
00:27:16,080 --> 00:27:17,120
Battalion Commander Guo,

473
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:20,240
not many people can defeat me, Long Yuanshan.

474
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:21,960
Losing to me

475
00:27:22,200 --> 00:27:23,000
is no disgrace.

476
00:27:23,280 --> 00:27:24,120
Well?

477
00:27:24,520 --> 00:27:25,560
Think about it.

478
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:28,920
That's a lot of information.

479
00:27:29,000 --> 00:27:30,400
I can't digest it all at once.

480
00:27:30,480 --> 00:27:32,280
What's there to digest?

481
00:27:32,280 --> 00:27:33,360
Our 404th Brigade

482
00:27:33,360 --> 00:27:35,240
is all about settling scores decisively,

483
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:36,320
and making decisive calls.

484
00:27:36,440 --> 00:27:37,920
I'm sure you'll like it.

485
00:27:39,720 --> 00:27:41,040
It is indeed very tempting.

486
00:27:41,200 --> 00:27:42,400
As long as you make up your mind,

487
00:27:42,840 --> 00:27:45,080
I'll handle all the relevant paperwork.

488
00:27:48,400 --> 00:27:49,280
Brigade Commander Long,

489
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:51,880
to receive your recognition,

490
00:27:52,160 --> 00:27:53,080
I am very grateful.

491
00:27:53,280 --> 00:27:55,320
My time as a soldier has been worth it.

492
00:27:55,840 --> 00:27:57,040
But I, Guo Zijian,

493
00:27:57,520 --> 00:28:00,480
am not someone who runs from difficulties.

494
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:02,760
Maybe what awaits me at the 396th Brigade

495
00:28:02,760 --> 00:28:04,120
is the harshest punishment,

496
00:28:04,240 --> 00:28:05,920
or I might be busted all the way down.

497
00:28:06,440 --> 00:28:07,480
But I believe

498
00:28:07,640 --> 00:28:08,800
where you fall

499
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:10,680
is where you should get back up.

500
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:12,280
Otherwise, if I run away,

501
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:14,720
I'll never be able to hold my head high.

502
00:28:17,440 --> 00:28:18,800
Since you think this way,

503
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:21,520
I, Long Yuanshan, respect you as a real man.

504
00:28:21,760 --> 00:28:23,920
It also proves I wasn't wrong about you.

505
00:28:24,280 --> 00:28:25,360
But I'll say this,

506
00:28:26,360 --> 00:28:27,840
no matter when,

507
00:28:28,000 --> 00:28:30,080
as long as you, Guo Zijian, say the word,

508
00:28:30,520 --> 00:28:31,800
I, Long Yuanshan,

509
00:28:31,880 --> 00:28:33,240
will always be waiting.

510
00:28:33,320 --> 00:28:34,680
I also hope that one day

511
00:28:35,080 --> 00:28:37,720
I can have an all-out battle with Brigade Commander Long.

512
00:28:38,040 --> 00:28:39,040
When that time comes,

513
00:28:39,520 --> 00:28:41,640
it's not certain who will win or lose.

514
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:44,440
It's a deal.

515
00:28:44,520 --> 00:28:45,920
I'll be waiting.

516
00:29:33,440 --> 00:29:35,400
Isn't this Long Yuanshan's license plate?

517
00:29:47,040 --> 00:29:48,760
I knew you'd be back late.

518
00:29:49,360 --> 00:29:51,040
Why are you back so late?

519
00:29:52,440 --> 00:29:54,080
Li Songwei, Lin Yihu, and the others

520
00:29:54,080 --> 00:29:55,520
waited for you until Taps.

521
00:29:55,600 --> 00:29:57,120
I chased them back to bed.

522
00:29:57,360 --> 00:29:58,120
They wouldn't leave.

523
00:29:58,120 --> 00:29:59,480
So I lied to them,

524
00:30:00,040 --> 00:30:01,320
saying you wouldn't be back until tomorrow.

525
00:30:01,320 --> 00:30:02,360
Only then did they leave.

526
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:03,360
Were you waiting for me?

527
00:30:03,480 --> 00:30:04,440
Why would I wait for you?

528
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:05,800
A grown man waiting up for you?

529
00:30:05,800 --> 00:30:06,440
I'd have to be crazy.

530
00:30:07,800 --> 00:30:08,440
Give me that.

531
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:10,200
Let's go to your room.

532
00:30:10,200 --> 00:30:11,280
Hurry up and wash your face.

533
00:30:25,640 --> 00:30:26,840
It's so clean.

534
00:30:29,280 --> 00:30:30,440
After you left,

535
00:30:30,640 --> 00:30:33,120
I wanted to come clean it for you every day.

536
00:30:33,480 --> 00:30:34,400
But I didn't expect

537
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:37,400
that every time I walked into this room,

538
00:30:38,520 --> 00:30:40,440
it would already be spotless.

539
00:30:46,440 --> 00:30:47,760
About your situation,

540
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:50,320
there's a decision.

541
00:30:50,960 --> 00:30:51,680
Tell me.

542
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,000
What's the decision?

543
00:30:54,360 --> 00:30:56,160
I've already prepared myself mentally.

544
00:30:57,000 --> 00:30:59,240
As long as I don't have to take off this uniform,

545
00:30:59,800 --> 00:31:00,960
I'll accept anything.

546
00:31:02,280 --> 00:31:03,440
The Brigade Party Committee has decided

547
00:31:05,160 --> 00:31:06,440
to relieve you of your post as Battalion Commander.

548
00:31:07,880 --> 00:31:09,120
You'll go to the Training Unit

549
00:31:11,400 --> 00:31:12,400
as a military instructor.

550
00:31:18,200 --> 00:31:19,040
When do I report?

551
00:31:19,440 --> 00:31:20,840
Go to the Human Resources Section

552
00:31:20,840 --> 00:31:21,600
and do the paperwork.

553
00:31:21,600 --> 00:31:23,400
You should be able to report anytime after that.

554
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:25,760
What about the 1st Battalion?

555
00:31:27,080 --> 00:31:28,080
Before a

556
00:31:28,960 --> 00:31:30,480
new Battalion Commander arrives,

557
00:31:31,480 --> 00:31:32,840
the Deputy Battalion Commander will fill in.

558
00:31:34,200 --> 00:31:35,440
Lin Yihu will serve as

559
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:36,840
the Recon Squad's

560
00:31:37,280 --> 00:31:38,000
acting Squad Leader.

561
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:40,520
Good.

562
00:31:42,680 --> 00:31:43,760
That puts my mind at ease.

563
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:45,600
I know

564
00:31:46,120 --> 00:31:47,120
that recently,

565
00:31:49,400 --> 00:31:50,720
you've all been worrying a lot

566
00:31:51,200 --> 00:31:52,080
about my situation.

567
00:31:54,760 --> 00:31:55,320
Thanks.

568
00:31:56,480 --> 00:31:57,560
Thanks for what?

569
00:31:58,560 --> 00:31:59,520
You're back home,

570
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:01,400
and you're acting so formally with me.

571
00:32:02,120 --> 00:32:02,760
It's only natural.

572
00:32:06,640 --> 00:32:07,600
Well, you

573
00:32:11,600 --> 00:32:12,680
should wash up first

574
00:32:13,320 --> 00:32:13,880
and get some sleep.

575
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:45,160
You know the disciplinary decision regarding you.

576
00:32:47,200 --> 00:32:48,560
If you have any complaints, speak up now.

577
00:32:49,080 --> 00:32:50,520
If you need to vent, do it quickly.

578
00:32:50,840 --> 00:32:51,920
Don't just stand there like a fool.

579
00:32:52,440 --> 00:32:53,240
I have a meeting to get to.

580
00:32:57,280 --> 00:32:58,280
Reporting, Commissar.

581
00:32:58,760 --> 00:33:00,120
I think the punishment is too light.

582
00:33:01,320 --> 00:33:02,920
At least you have some self-awareness.

583
00:33:04,120 --> 00:33:05,000
It is indeed too light.

584
00:33:05,800 --> 00:33:06,680
If it were up to me,

585
00:33:06,960 --> 00:33:07,680
you should be

586
00:33:07,680 --> 00:33:08,440
busted all the way down

587
00:33:08,600 --> 00:33:09,880
to start over as a platoon leader.

588
00:33:10,480 --> 00:33:11,600
You're right, Commissar.

589
00:33:11,600 --> 00:33:12,480
I have no objections.

590
00:33:14,840 --> 00:33:15,760
But the organization,

591
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:18,040
when dealing with an officer's career progression,

592
00:33:18,680 --> 00:33:19,960
not only uses an iron fist,

593
00:33:19,960 --> 00:33:21,080
but also has a velvet glove.

594
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:23,280
I'll tell you the truth.

595
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:25,280
When the working group was at the 1st Battalion

596
00:33:25,520 --> 00:33:27,200
listening to opinions on your case,

597
00:33:27,560 --> 00:33:28,960
every single officer and soldier

598
00:33:30,360 --> 00:33:31,320
tried to defend you.

599
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:34,040
Especially that kid Li Songwei.

600
00:33:34,480 --> 00:33:35,160
He went the furthest.

601
00:33:35,480 --> 00:33:37,200
He even thought an officer like you

602
00:33:37,320 --> 00:33:38,800
should be given more responsibility.

603
00:33:45,000 --> 00:33:45,640
Therefore,

604
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:46,720
this time,

605
00:33:47,360 --> 00:33:48,240
considering

606
00:33:48,920 --> 00:33:49,680
that in the 1st Battalion,

607
00:33:49,920 --> 00:33:50,920
you led the officers and soldiers

608
00:33:51,360 --> 00:33:53,520
to outstanding performance on the training ground,

609
00:33:54,080 --> 00:33:55,360
considering that during the exercise,

610
00:33:55,600 --> 00:33:57,440
your only pursuit was to win,

611
00:33:57,440 --> 00:33:58,200
and most importantly, considering

612
00:33:59,120 --> 00:34:01,560
your prestige among the 1st Battalion troops,

613
00:34:02,640 --> 00:34:03,600
after comprehensive evaluation,

614
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:04,680
the organization has decided

615
00:34:05,320 --> 00:34:06,440
to show you leniency.

616
00:34:07,080 --> 00:34:08,960
Although you were stripped of your Battalion Commander post,

617
00:34:09,679 --> 00:34:11,120
your Battalion Commander Rank

618
00:34:11,440 --> 00:34:12,000
wasn't lowered.

619
00:34:14,639 --> 00:34:15,320
Thank you, Commissar.

620
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:16,320
Why are you thanking me?

621
00:34:17,040 --> 00:34:18,920
If Comrade Suo Jian'an hadn't taken the high road

622
00:34:19,080 --> 00:34:21,520
and stopped pursuing the matter against a hothead like you,

623
00:34:22,679 --> 00:34:23,840
what the outcome would have been

624
00:34:24,840 --> 00:34:25,760
is really hard to say.

625
00:34:26,480 --> 00:34:27,520
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo...

626
00:34:31,120 --> 00:34:31,639
Commissar,

627
00:34:31,880 --> 00:34:32,679
I understand everything.

628
00:34:32,679 --> 00:34:33,679
What do you know?

629
00:34:34,600 --> 00:34:35,239
I'm telling you,

630
00:34:35,440 --> 00:34:36,320
from now on,

631
00:34:36,679 --> 00:34:37,679
this disciplinary action

632
00:34:37,679 --> 00:34:38,920
stays in your file.

633
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:40,560
It will be kept there forever.

634
00:34:40,560 --> 00:34:41,719
Even your future descendants

635
00:34:42,360 --> 00:34:43,280
won't be able to erase it.

636
00:34:44,239 --> 00:34:44,719
I know.

637
00:34:53,600 --> 00:34:54,800
After this trip home,

638
00:34:55,320 --> 00:34:56,159
you've made a lot of progress.

639
00:34:57,720 --> 00:34:59,640
You finally know about keeping a low profile.

640
00:34:59,640 --> 00:35:00,200
我都这样了
Translation>
Commissar,

641
00:35:00,720 --> 00:35:01,560
since I'm already in this state,

642
00:35:01,560 --> 00:35:03,040
please don't make fun of me.

643
00:35:10,920 --> 00:35:11,800
You kid.

644
00:35:12,240 --> 00:35:13,560
When you see Deputy Brigade Commander Suo later,

645
00:35:14,160 --> 00:35:15,200
you know what to do, right?

646
00:35:15,560 --> 00:35:16,080
Yes, I know.

647
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:18,480
Go on.

648
00:35:18,920 --> 00:35:19,440
Yes, sir.

649
00:35:32,600 --> 00:35:34,440
I have no objections in principle.

650
00:35:35,440 --> 00:35:37,600
I'll make a few minor tweaks

651
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:38,680
and send it to you later.

652
00:35:39,760 --> 00:35:40,480
Sounds good.

653
00:35:41,240 --> 00:35:41,840
Thank you.

654
00:35:50,440 --> 00:35:52,040
This is hardly a minor issue.

655
00:36:02,600 --> 00:36:04,960
Everyone has their own code of conduct.

656
00:36:05,520 --> 00:36:06,720
As for many of your actions,

657
00:36:07,720 --> 00:36:08,680
I was involved too,

658
00:36:10,280 --> 00:36:11,480
so it's not my place to say much.

659
00:36:13,400 --> 00:36:14,320
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

660
00:36:14,880 --> 00:36:16,040
a mistake is a mistake.

661
00:36:16,640 --> 00:36:17,560
I apologize to you.

662
00:36:18,680 --> 00:36:19,960
There's no need to apologize.

663
00:36:21,560 --> 00:36:23,480
I'm not the one you've wronged.

664
00:36:24,720 --> 00:36:25,520
Right or wrong

665
00:36:26,240 --> 00:36:28,200
will be judged by military regulations and party discipline.

666
00:36:28,680 --> 00:36:29,520
Besides,

667
00:36:30,640 --> 00:36:32,240
the organization has already reached a conclusion.

668
00:36:33,280 --> 00:36:34,160
I have no objections.

669
00:36:37,880 --> 00:36:39,280
It was indeed my fault.

670
00:36:39,840 --> 00:36:40,720
I was too immature.

671
00:36:41,600 --> 00:36:43,600
Just give me a harsh reprimand.

672
00:36:48,160 --> 00:36:49,280
Wait, what do you mean?

673
00:36:50,320 --> 00:36:51,600
What kind of person do you take me for?

674
00:36:53,120 --> 00:36:54,080
Alright, alright.

675
00:36:54,520 --> 00:36:55,520
I'm busy right now.

676
00:36:56,360 --> 00:36:57,680
We're done here for today.

677
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:09,280
Yes, sir.

678
00:37:32,840 --> 00:37:33,520
Political Instructor!

679
00:37:34,160 --> 00:37:35,720
Battalion Commander Guo is leaving due to disciplinary action.

680
00:37:36,160 --> 00:37:37,880
Giving him such a grand send-off,

681
00:37:38,440 --> 00:37:40,320
isn't this clearly going to cause trouble for the leaders?

682
00:37:40,760 --> 00:37:41,840
Won't people say we

683
00:37:42,160 --> 00:37:43,200
lack a sense of the big picture?

684
00:37:44,560 --> 00:37:45,040
Yes,

685
00:37:46,920 --> 00:37:48,640
the Battalion Commander was disciplined,

686
00:37:49,240 --> 00:37:49,840
and that's why he's leaving.

687
00:37:51,520 --> 00:37:52,520
But as for our Battalion Commander,

688
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,600
the changes he brought to the 1st Battalion

689
00:37:56,680 --> 00:37:57,760
are obvious to everyone.

690
00:37:58,360 --> 00:37:59,160
His contributions are undeniable.

691
00:38:00,040 --> 00:38:00,640
So,

692
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:02,720
we must give our Battalion Commander a proper send-off.

693
00:38:03,200 --> 00:38:04,160
If doing this

694
00:38:05,720 --> 00:38:06,800
is considered causing trouble for the leaders,

695
00:38:07,960 --> 00:38:08,960
or lacking a sense of the big picture,

696
00:38:11,040 --> 00:38:12,520
I am willing to accept any punishment.

697
00:38:19,840 --> 00:38:20,520
Comrades!

698
00:38:22,960 --> 00:38:24,080
Our Battalion Commander

699
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:26,320
is about to leave us.

700
00:38:28,880 --> 00:38:29,920
I hope everyone

701
00:38:30,240 --> 00:38:32,080
can give him the warmest applause

702
00:38:32,920 --> 00:38:33,640
to see him off.

703
00:38:34,480 --> 00:38:35,320
But all of you,

704
00:38:36,360 --> 00:38:37,960
no pulling long faces.

705
00:38:39,600 --> 00:38:41,240
And absolutely no tears.

706
00:38:42,120 --> 00:38:43,120
And above all,

707
00:38:43,880 --> 00:38:45,720
don't make things harder for our Battalion Commander.

708
00:38:46,520 --> 00:38:47,440
Is that clear?

709
00:38:47,520 --> 00:38:48,200
Yes, sir!

710
00:38:48,800 --> 00:38:49,400
Report!

711
00:38:50,600 --> 00:38:51,320
Political Instructor!

712
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:52,080
The Battalion Commander is here!

713
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:18,040
What's wrong, Battalion Commander?

714
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:19,920
Your own soldiers...

715
00:39:20,800 --> 00:39:22,160
Starting to look unfamiliar?

716
00:39:25,000 --> 00:39:25,520
Lao Sang,

717
00:39:27,560 --> 00:39:29,160
isn't this giving them ammunition?

718
00:39:29,640 --> 00:39:30,280
Don't you worry.

719
00:39:32,680 --> 00:39:33,400
Today,

720
00:39:34,360 --> 00:39:35,200
everything

721
00:39:35,760 --> 00:39:36,400
follows my lead.

722
00:39:43,440 --> 00:39:44,320
Comrades!

723
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:48,200
Our Battalion Commander,

724
00:39:49,520 --> 00:39:50,800
at this very moment,

725
00:39:51,800 --> 00:39:53,640
is about to leave our 1st Battalion

726
00:39:54,600 --> 00:39:56,600
to serve at the Training Unit.

727
00:39:58,040 --> 00:39:59,360
I hope

728
00:39:59,960 --> 00:40:01,360
we can

729
00:40:01,360 --> 00:40:03,520
offer our warmest applause

730
00:40:04,600 --> 00:40:06,520
to wish our Battalion Commander

731
00:40:07,800 --> 00:40:09,520
continued success

732
00:40:10,240 --> 00:40:12,200
and swift victories.

733
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:13,440
Applause!

734
00:41:27,880 --> 00:41:29,840
About face!

735
00:41:32,960 --> 00:41:34,920
Salute!

736
00:42:48,800 --> 00:42:49,800
Isn't this

737
00:42:50,280 --> 00:42:51,800
the high and mighty Battalion Commander Guo?
